<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Sui Chong shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Sui Chong shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday that trading in the shares of Sui Chong Holdings Ltd was suspended at 10.15 am (0215 gmt) pending an announcement.  </p>
<p>The shares surged HK$0.17 to HK$0.97 before the suspension.</p>
<p>They rose about 57 percent, putting on HK$0.29 to HK$0.80, on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sui Chong, a construction and property firm, is a subsidiary of Winfoong Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
